  "title": "More Than Ice Cream: Celebrating the People Behind a Strong Quarter",
  "summary": "Recognition comes in many forms. Sometimes, it arrives in the shape of a scoop of ice cream shared with coworkers on a summer afternoon. On July 14, our teams in Ludwigsstadt and Sonneberg, Germany, came together to celebrate a successful second quarter with a special treat from a nearby organic farm known throughout the region for its handcrafted ice cream.",
